  "notes": "{熱|あつ}い refers to hot objects/liquids and passionate feelings.\n\nDISTINCTION FROM SIMILAR WORDS:\n- {熱|あつ}い: hot to the touch (objects, liquids); passionate\n- ⟦{暑|あつ}い→暑い：00619_atsui⟧: hot weather, uncomfortable heat\n- ⟦{厚|あつ}い→厚い：00690_atsui⟧: thick (objects)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {熱|あつ}い⟦お{湯|ゆ}→お湯：02518_oyu⟧: hot water\n- {熱|あつ}い⟦コーヒー→コーヒー：00789_koohii⟧: hot coffee\n- {熱|あつ}い⟦{視線|しせん}→視線：14138_shisen⟧: passionate gaze\n- {熱|あつ}い⟦{戦|たたか}い→戦い：02070_tatakai⟧: heated battle\n- ⟦{胸|むね}が{熱|あつ}くなる→胸が熱くなる：20455_munegaatsukunaru⟧: to feel moved/emotional\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverbial: {熱|あつ}く\n- Noun form: {熱|あつ}さ (heat intensity)\n\nIDIOMATIC:\n- {熱|あつ}い⟦{思|おも}い→思い：10248_omoi⟧: passionate feelings\n- ⟦{鉄|てつ}→鉄：02225_tetsu⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{熱|あつ}いうち⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{打|う}て→打つ：01221_utsu⟧: Strike while the iron is hot",
